---
import DeviceFrame from "../DeviceFrame.astro";
import Clip from "../Clip.astro";
import Cta from "../Cta.astro";
---
<section id="top" class="relative pt-28 sm:pt-36" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="container-site text-center">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Per il ping pong</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title" class="text-hero mx-auto mt-4 max-w-[14ch] text-balance" data-reveal style="--reveal-index:1">
      Solo gli scambi. Niente&nbsp;attese.
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lead text-soft mx-auto mt-6 max-w-[38ch] text-pretty" data-reveal style="--reveal-index:2">
      Danamus trova da solo ogni scambio nel video della partita e taglia i tempi morti. Poi lo rifinisci tu, nell'editor.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col items-center gap-4" data-reveal style="--reveal-index:3">
      <Cta class="justify-center" />
      <p class="text-caption text-muted">Per Mac, Windows e iPhone. Senza abbonamento.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container-site mt-14 sm:mt-20">
    <div class="hero-phone mx-auto" data-scroll-zoom>
      <DeviceFrame variant="phone" width={720} height={1558}>
        <Clip id="clip-preview" displayWidth={280} eager />
      </DeviceFrame>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-phone { width: min(340px, 78vw); }
</style>
